msgid "armorPatching/alt/description"
msgstr "受到伤害会中断血量恢复。\n\n血量恢复率与恢复上限以战车的总血量为基准，包括所有应用的变项。"

msgid "armorPatching/alt/info"
msgstr "团体特长考量所有乘员的平均训练程度。在训练到至少1%时生效，效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "armorPatching/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "使用修理箱后可在5秒期间恢复战车%(hpRecover)s的{yellow_Start}血量{yellow_End}，每场战斗最多恢复20%。即便未受到严重伤害，也能使用修理箱。"

msgid "armorPatching/hudDescription"
msgstr "血量已恢复。"

msgid "armorPatching/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "所有乘员完成此项训练时，使用修理箱后可在5秒期间恢复战车%(hpRecover)s的{yellow_Start}血量{yellow_End}，每场战斗最多恢复20%。即便未受到严重伤害，也能使用修理箱。"

msgid "armorPatching/name"
msgstr "装甲修补"

msgid "armorPatching/shortDescription"
msgstr "@ 提高战车的基础隐蔽性。"

msgid "brotherhood/alt/description"
msgstr "乘员熟练度加成会影响乘员的战斗效率并提升其所有已学会的特长的效果，但不适用于此特长。此参数可通过安装类似效果的装备或消耗品，或使用“空气净化设备”指令来进一步提高。车长的“应急手段”特长，以及通信兵的“并排奋战”和“通信技术”特长也能提高此参数。"

msgid "brotherhood/alt/info"
msgstr "团体特长考量所有乘员的平均训练程度。在训练到至少1%时生效，效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "brotherhood/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "已提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s全体乘员的{greenBright_Start}乘员熟练度加成{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "brotherhood/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "全体乘员完成此项训练时，提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s全体乘员的{greenBright_Start}乘员熟练度加成{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "brotherhood/name"
msgstr "兄弟连"

msgid "brotherhood/shortDescription"
msgstr "提升整体乘员表现。"

msgid "camouflage/alt/description"
msgstr "此特长影响战车的隐蔽性。可使用“自然遮盖”指令进一步增强。\n\n此外，战车隐蔽性也可通过安装具有类似效果的迷彩、风格或装备来提高。"

msgid "camouflage/alt/info"
msgstr "团体特长考量所有乘员的平均训练程度。在训练到至少1%时生效，效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "camouflage/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "已提高%(maskingFactor)s战车{greenBright_Start}隐蔽性{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "camouflage/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "全体乘员完成此项训练时，提高%(maskingFactor)s战车{greenBright_Start}隐蔽性{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "camouflage/name"
msgstr "伪装"

msgid "camouflage/shortDescription"
msgstr "提高战车的基础隐蔽性。"

msgid "commander_coordination/alt/description"
msgstr "效果在每次侦察到敌方战车时激活，但侦察多辆战车效果不会叠加。\n\n瞄准速度可通过训练炮手的“快速瞄准”特长或安装类似效果的装备进一步提高。"

msgid "commander_coordination/alt/info"
msgstr "具有触发式效果的特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。触发式效果在您于战斗中满足特定条件时触发。"

msgid "commander_coordination/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "在您侦察到敌方战车后{yellow_Start}瞄准速度{yellow_End}提高%(vehicleGunAimSpeed)s，持续15秒。"

msgid "commander_coordination/hudDescription"
msgstr "瞄准速度已提高。"

msgid "commander_coordination/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，侦察到敌方战车后提高%(vehicleGunAimSpeed)s{yellow_Start}瞄准速度{yellow_End}，持续15秒。\t"

msgid "commander_coordination/name"
msgstr "协调合作"

msgid "commander_coordination/shortDescription"
msgstr "瞄准速度已提高。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/alt/description"
msgstr "视野范围可通过训练通信兵的“态势感知”特长或安装类似效果的装备来进一步提高。使用“光学测定仪”指令可提升效果。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/alt/info"
msgstr "特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "已扩大%(circularVisionRadius)s{greenBright_Start}视野范围{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。{greenBright_Start}观察设备受损的惩罚{greenBright_End}降低%(penaltyToDamagedSurveyingDevice)s&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/hudDescription"
msgstr "观察设备受损的惩罚已降低。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，扩大%(circularVisionRadius)s{greenBright_Start}视野范围{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;，且{greenBright_Start}观察设备受损的惩罚{greenBright_End}降低%(penaltyToDamagedSurveyingDevice)s&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/name"
msgstr "侦查"

msgid "commander_eagleEye/shortDescription"
msgstr "提高视野范围，观测设备受损时效果更显著。"

msgid "commander_emergency/alt/description"
msgstr "重复受到同一名敌人的伤害时，效果不会叠加。乘员熟练度加成会影响乘员的战斗效率。此参数可通过安装类似效果的装备或消耗品，或使用“空气净化设备”指令来进一步提高。“兄弟连”团体特长，以及通信兵的“并排奋战”和“通信技术”特长也能提高此参数。"

msgid "commander_emergency/alt/info"
msgstr "具有触发式效果的特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。触发式效果在您于战斗中满足特定条件时触发。"

msgid "commander_emergency/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "受到敌方伤害后提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s{yellow_Start}乘员熟练度加成{yellow_End}，持续15秒。"

msgid "commander_emergency/hudDescription"
msgstr "乘员熟练度加成已提高。"

msgid "commander_emergency/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，受到敌方伤害后提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s{yellow_Start}乘员熟练度加成，{yellow_End}持续15秒。"

msgid "commander_emergency/name"
msgstr "应急手段"

msgid "commander_emergency/shortDescription"
msgstr "乘员熟练度加成已提高。"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/alt/description"
msgstr "在敌方自行火炮射击后发起警报，但有短暂延迟。\n\n此特长可使用“高度警戒”指令进一步增强。"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/alt/info"
msgstr "具有触发式效果的特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。触发式效果在您于战斗中满足特定条件时触发。"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "在敌方自行火炮射击的%(artNotificationDelayFactor)s延迟后{yellow_Start}发起警报{yellow_End}并显示射击的来源方向。已降低%(stunResistanceEffectFactor)s{greenBright_Start}震晕的负面效果{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，在敌方自行火炮射击的\n%(artNotificationDelayFactor)s延迟后{yellow_Start}发起警报{yellow_End}并显示射击的来源方向。降低%(stunResistanceEffectFactor)s{greenBright_Start}震晕的负面效果{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/name"
msgstr "声音侦测"

msgid "commander_enemyShotPredictor/shortDescription"
msgstr "敌方自行火炮的射击提示。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/alt/description"
msgstr "乘员熟练度加成会提高乘员在战斗中的效率。\n\n此参数可通过安装类似效果的装备或消耗品，或使用“空气净化设备”指令来进一步提高。其他多种乘员特长也能提高此参数。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/alt/info"
msgstr "具有触发式效果的特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。触发式效果在您于战斗中满足特定条件时触发。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "若敌队在战斗中战车数比我方多出至少三辆时，提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s{yellow_Start}乘员熟练度加成{yellow_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/hudDescription"
msgstr "乘员熟练度加成已提高（敌方数量占优势）。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，若敌方团队在战斗中战车数比我方多出至少三辆，提高%(crewLevelIncrease)s{yellow_Start}乘员熟练度加成{yellow_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_holdLine/name"
msgstr "以寡敌众"

msgid "commander_holdLine/shortDescription"
msgstr "@ 提高乘员熟练度加成"

msgid "commander_practical/alt/description"
msgstr "此特长对战车上安装的所有类型消耗品生效。\n\n其效果可使用“万全准备”指令进一步增强。"

msgid "commander_practical/alt/info"
msgstr "特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "commander_practical/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "已缩短%(equipmentPreparationTime)s{greenBright_Start}消耗品冷却时间{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_practical/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练时，缩短%(equipmentPreparationTime)s{greenBright_Start}消耗品冷却时间{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "commander_practical/name"
msgstr "熟能生巧"

