msgstr "完成此项训练后，提高%(xpBonusFactorPerLevel)s全体乘员的{greenBright_Start}经验获取量{greenBright_End}。车长能够以%(woundedCrewEfficiency)s效率{greenBright_Start}顶替失去行动力的{greenBright_End}乘员履行职能。"

