msgstr "已提高%(vehicleForwardMaxSpeed)s{greenBright_Start}最大前进{greenBright_End}和{greenBright_Start}最大倒车速度{greenBright_End}。已降低%(vehPenaltyForDamagedEngine)s{greenBright_Start}发动机受损的惩罚{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

