msgstr "完成此项训练时，提高%(vehicleForwardMaxSpeed)s{greenBright_Start}最大前进{greenBright_End}和{greenBright_Start}最大倒车速度{greenBright_End}。降低%(vehPenaltyForDamagedEngine)s{greenBright_Start}发动机受损的惩罚{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "driver_motorExpert/name"
msgstr "工程知识"

msgid "driver_motorExpert/shortDescription"
msgstr "发动机受损的惩罚已降低。"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/alt/description"
msgstr "与队友战车碰撞时特长无效。\n\n您战车承受的撞击伤害可通过安装类似效果的装备进一步降低。"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/alt/info"
msgstr "特长在训练到至少1%时生效，且效果随训练程度提高而逐渐增强。"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/currentLvlDescription"
msgstr "已提高%(damageEnemiesByRamming)s{greenBright_Start}对敌方战车的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。已降低\n%(vehicleRamDamageResistance)s{greenBright_Start}您战车承受的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;，以及%(vehicleRamChassisDamageResistance)s{greenBright_Start}您的悬挂承受的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/maxLvlDescription"
msgstr "完成此项训练后，提高%(damageEnemiesByRamming)s{greenBright_Start}对敌方战车的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。降低%(vehicleRamDamageResistance)s{greenBright_Start}您战车承受的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;，以及%(vehicleRamChassisDamageResistance)s{greenBright_Start}您的悬挂承受的撞击伤害{greenBright_End}&zwnbsp;。"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/name"
msgstr "专注撞击"

msgid "driver_rammingMaster/shortDescription"
